  "shot_id": "43-bridge-throne",
  "description": "The cover-art view: the DJ sits cross-legged on the throne inside the glowing blue ring, headphones on, singing. Slow hand movements: a raised open palm, hands together at the chest, then joined in the lap, eyes closed. The two cracked stone heads flank the throne, blue flames dripping from their lips into the braziers; red neon bars; the crowd's heads and raised fists silhouetted in the foreground.",
  "characters": [
   "the DJ",
   "crowd"
  ],
  "lyrics": [
   {
    "t": 95.28,
    "text": "“Without own-nature”",
    "sanskrit": "निःस्वभावा",
    "iast": "niḥsvabhāvā"
   },
   {
    "t": 97.28,
    "text": "they say",
    "sanskrit": "इति वदन्ति",
    "iast": "iti vadanti"
   },
   {
